        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_gu_master"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The skin of a myriad eyes clear bull’s head is full of water path dao marks, and the lifeforms in Falling Heavenly River are mostly related to water path, with few fire path lifeforms there.",
      "chapters": [
        994
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "what-the-path-governs",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_falling_heavenly_river"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Eastern Sea’s Song clan specialized in water path and kept a signature water path inheritance called flowing water. Its defensive killer moves include noncorroding flowing water, emotionless flowing water, and flowering flowing water, which guard against poison path, wisdom path, and wood path respectively. Other named moves cover movement, immortal essence expenditure, a food path mimic effect, and help with killer move activation. Song Yi Shi practices the passive defensive killer move noncorroding flowing water by carving a water path defensive killer move on the body so that a poison path attack activates it on its own. In that stretch Fang Yuan is a great grandmaster in water path.",
      "chapters": [
        2238
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
